    profiles are not yet read (the <strong>1851 baptism</strong> has since been read, above, from the
    archive scan): the <strong>1891 birth</strong> of
    Catherine Mary Sophia, a <strong>Johanna Catharina birth</strong> entry, the
    <strong>Anna–George marriage certificate</strong>, and two further pages of death information.</p>
</section>
